  "full_response": "# **Incident Response Report: Credential Leak in Public GitHub Repository**\n\n**Incident ID:** IR-2023-0045\n**Date of Incident:** [Insert Date]\n**Date of Detection:** [Insert Date]\n**Report Date:** [Insert Date]\n**Prepared by:** [Your Name/Team]\n**Severity:** **Critical** (High risk of financial fraud, data breach, and service disruption)\n\n---\n\n## **1. Executive Summary**\nOn **[Date of Detection]**, the Security Operations Center (SOC) detected an unauthorized exposure of sensitive credentials in a public GitHub repository belonging to **[Company Name]**. The leaked credentials included:\n- **Payment Processing API Keys** (Stripe, PayPal, etc.)\n- **Email Service API Keys** (SendGrid, Mailchimp, etc.)\n- **Cloud Infrastructure Credentials** (AWS, Azure, GCP)\n\nThe exposure was caused by a developer accidentally committing a `.env` file containing production secrets to a public repository. Immediate containment actions were taken, including key revocation, repository takedown, and forensic analysis. No evidence of malicious exploitation was found at the time of this report.\n\n**Impact:**\n- **Financial Risk:** Unauthorized payment processing could lead to fraudulent transactions.\n- **Operational Risk:** Cloud infrastructure compromise could result in data breaches or service outages.\n- **Reputational Risk:** Loss of customer trust due to potential data exposure.\n\n**Current Status:** **Contained** (Credentials revoked, repository secured, monitoring in place)\n\n---\n\n## **2. Incident Timeline**\n\n| **Time (UTC)**       | **Event** |\n|----------------------|-----------|\n| **[Date] 14:30**     | Developer commits `.env` file to public GitHub repo (accidental). |\n| **[Date] 15:45**     | GitHub Secret Scanning alerts SOC to exposed API keys. |\n| **[Date] 16:00**     | SOC confirms incident, initiates response protocol. |\n| **[Date] 16:15**     | Repository made private; GitHub support contacted for takedown. |\n| **[Date] 16:30**     | All exposed API keys revoked and rotated. |\n| **[Date] 17:00**     | Cloud provider (AWS/Azure/GCP) notified for additional monitoring. |\n| **[Date] 18:30",
